-  en:{title:'Cookie Policy',html:'<p>This website does not use analytics, advertising or other non-essential tracking tools. It stores your language preference in your browser local storage. Our hosting provider may process limited technical data in server logs to deliver and secure the site.</p><p>For details about personal data submitted through the contact form, please see our <a class="privacy-link" data-privacy>Privacy Policy</a>.</p>'},
